Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, sir. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, are you feeling any better today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly honest, this new way\Nof life isn't exactly agreeing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And have you had any discomfort?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The painkillers must be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're thrilled that you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Doctor, about these, how\Nlong will I have to keep them on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I can't\Nafford to wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Kakyoin, while\Nyour eyes will recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your condition is nothing\Nto be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be in our care for quite\Nsome time, so please be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is, we just don't\Nknow how long you're going to remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true your body still needs\Ntime to properly heal itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for some strange reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doctors from the Speedwagon Foundation\Nrecently contacted us out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they've asked that we entrust\Nyour medical care to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I have little doubt\Ntheir state-of-the-art
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,medical treatments will prove\Nto be more than effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell me, who are you\Nbehind that schoolboy facade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you must know, that\Nfoundation is world famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine they'd want anything to\Ndo with an average high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I'm fortunate to\Nhave a very dependable friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll be seeing each\Nother again sooner than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, Polnareff, Avdol, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.50,0:01:51.34,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:02:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one who is not in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A moment of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who has brought me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who is in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one who is in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.34,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(652,0)\pos(151,850)}Episode 30: Bast's Mariah, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Located in southern Egypt\Nis the city of Luxor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the ancient Egyptians, however,\Nit was the site of Thebes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is in this location,\Non the west bank of the Nile,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the pharaohs of\Nold were laid to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is known as the Valley of the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of the tomb of\Nthe great king Tutankhamen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It lies here in the Valley of the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this place is chock full of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what I've heard is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some of the residents of this area\Nstill dig beneath their houses
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in search of treasure without\Npermission from the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think those ancient guys left\Nbehind any undiscovered treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys see where the old man ran off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes to the bathroom and\Nhe took Iggy since he can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,detect enemies that's so\Ndo you need to go hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My might if it's a normal bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The climate in this\Nplace is so damn arid the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crap dries up turns the\Ndust and blows away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means instead of using water,\Nthis toilet relies solely on wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't see any toilet paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that... Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some sort of sand basin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you wipe your ass with sand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert sand is as sterile as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll pull a pole in the wrap\Nand wait till we get back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point of a shack\Nif you're going in a hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well just do\Nyour business behind a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is weird even\Nfor a place like Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make the\Nslightest bit of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would think\Nto put an electrical outlet in a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it's used for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no electricity out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn thing electrocuted me! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should probably get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That scared the living\Ndaylights out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's still live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the cables must run\Nunderground or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never tell with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like traveling\Nthrough a fantasy land.
