Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now how did that old saying go again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curiosity killed the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could make it to Cairo in two days,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:07:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since all of us are\Ninjured and exhausted,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't we spend tonight and tomorrow\Nin Luxor and use that time to recuperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since we got to Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the enemy stands have been\Ngetting stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been winning these battles\Nby the skin of our teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, is something wrong? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My prosthetic hand is\Nacting funny, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably just need to oil the joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, shopkeeper, can you\Nplease do something about that radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was made in Japan, and I\Njust bought the darn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just static now. Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd probably be in our best interest\Nto rest up before heading to Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we can't let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's find a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:07:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the drinks, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The radio's working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.09,0:08:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why is the hammer suddenly so heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nails!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, did you bang\Nyour finger with the hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just go throwin'\Nhammers around, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, it's time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry it up in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff is going on\Nand on about the four
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of us finding somewhere to eat breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and wake him up, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got five minutes\Nbefore I come up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought old people\Nwere supposed to get up early!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, smart Alec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no respect for his elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him I'll be down in just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did my watch stop working?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You toss and turn in your sleep\Nquite a bit for a man your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't noticed yet, but\Nyou're facing the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went to bed facing south, but\Nwoke up northward like a compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you still have a youthful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be downstairs when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something strange has been going\Non ever since yesterday afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and for some reason my\Nhand is still acting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is up with this freaky chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blasted thing's moving on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know any better, I'd guess\Nthe floors in this place were slanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For such a ritzy hotel, it sure\Ndoes seem like it was cheaply made.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I had an amazing time looking around\NKarnak, so I'd say something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about the Valley\Nof the Queens instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're\Ndoing, you old pervert jackass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
