Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate your forwardness, but\Nyou need to work on your approach,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you naughty, naughty man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that said, you're just my Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here, really wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's been this way ever\Nsince yesterday afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're stuck to my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, it's all starting to make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason why all these metal\Nobjects are suddenly attracted to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's turned into a magnet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this insanity might\Nbe the work of a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's the case,\Nwhy can't I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could these knives and forks\Nfly at me if the stand isn't nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this really be a\Nside effect of the shock
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took from the socket\Non that rock yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it didn't even cross my mind\Nthat the escalator's made of steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The magnetic pull's getting\Nstronger by the minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, lady in the miniskirt,\NI need you to help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, miss, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to be rude, but your\Nchain's wrapped around my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it'd be nice if you'd get it off\Nme before I'm shredded to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not much time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so if you could push the emergency\Nstop button, that'd be swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, lady, the chains\Nare pulling me tighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's gonna rip\Noff my hands and feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the ride, Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know who I am, that\Nwould make you the stand user!
