Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone stop this infernal escalator!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll push the emergency stop\Nbutton, using my Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense! Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason that I'd\Nhave this much trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finding it would be if it didn't have one,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that can't be possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What escalator doesn't\Nhave a shut-off button?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pulling me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My neck! My neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna cut off my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, cruel world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The escalator stopped some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already pushed the\Nemergency stop button.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on the side instead of in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just inspected this escalator\Nand it's in working order!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be happy to know the\Nemergency button works fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the owner\Nof this establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'll be\Nneeding your signature right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:15:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lost, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.22,0:16:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An enemy's stand managed\Nto tag me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now my body's turned into one big magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, the user turned me into a\Nmagnet, and now metal's attracted to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you pull this thing off of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the magnetic\Npull is becoming stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the longer the stand's\Npower remains in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman there is the stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find a way to stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have to get rid of this\Ninsane magnetic pull somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I won't be able to move my body at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should also get Jojaro and Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
