Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Avdol, there's no\Ntime to get the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look, she's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move away, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, just run after her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get a good look at her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever, she went into the\Nladies room. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life is on the line here, so I guess I\Nhave to catch this vixen no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol went inside to find him,\Nbut he hasn't come back either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if those two snuck off? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably having an\Namazing breakfast as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more likely he's taking\Nhis time in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if they don't show up in the next\Nfive minutes, we'll go look for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, come to think of it, the\Nbathrooms in this hotel are spotless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, now that we're in here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as I expected. We\Nhave a problem on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me but I I\Nhaven't the foggiest clue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which stall she's in do\Nyou have a way to find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well for one she's got amazing\Nlegs legs that's right just look
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For those legs, believe me\Nwhen I say you can't miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we have to take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she's not in this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No again.
