Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're that handsome fellow from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came all the way here to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dirty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heart wants what the heart wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit! It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the hag from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the second floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:20:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought for sure those\Nwere the legs of the sand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you screw that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run out the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to be\Ntreated like a peeping Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holder is the one who should be\Ngetting called a dirty pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dirty old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perverts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's ferrumptious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's headed that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did that harlot get so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you, whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's imperative that you refrain\Nfrom touching any electrical outlets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She manifests her stand\Nthrough the outlets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you touch one,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll get zapped and the magnetism\Nwill begin to take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I already\Ndid, Mr. Joestar. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I touched one when I pushed the\Nemergency stop button on the escalator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a socket directly beside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I had known.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that conniving minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind giving me some space?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run with you\Nstuck to me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to say the same to you, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's running close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what I know about magnets is\Ntrue, we're being forced together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe she managed to\Nturn me into a magnet as well. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I really hate saying\Nthis, but... Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotten ourselves\Ninto a world of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at a complete loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.47,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is stronger than it was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is pure evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what should we do if we don't get free?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've run away from fights before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've only done so\Nwhen running was part?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the overall strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real showdown begins now!
